Another Hyperdimension game here~
Some pluses:
+ Nep~Nep;
+ Awesome music and graphics as always;
+ Many playable characters;
+ Zombies;
+ Film production;
+ Gameplay better then in HDNAU;
+++ Co-op for 4 players;
++++ Blanc as main protag.
And minuses:
- Grind, some players don't like it;
- Story is worse than in MDNVII;
So I think this game is good spin-off for big HDN fans.
I didn't find any bugs so it's also a good port from Vita.
10 of 10 Blanc's approved.

